  "readmeFile": "NugetREADME.md",
  "releaseNotes": "DicomWebServer.StreamStowRequests added to replace PassStowAsStream (currently made obsolete and will be removed at a later date)\nDicomWebServer.StreamWadoResponses added to stream responses to client\nDicomWebClient.RetrieveNativeStreamAsync(..) added to allow incremental reading of streamed responses\nDicomWebServer handles different sort of WADO native and metadata requests better (single-part and multipart)\nto meet Standards requirements.\nBetter frame level support for WadoNative requests\nFFmpeg .musl shared libraries are provided in DicomObjects for the Linux Alphine runtime.\nDicomDataSet.FrameSubSet fix to return the datasets in the correct order\nDicomWebServer better validation and responses statues based on users request\nCharLS added in to DicomObjects\nInstanceUID is updated for all Lossy Transfer Syntaxes (some were being missed)",
  "requireLicenseAcceptance": false,
  "verbatimVersion": "10.0.7",
